{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18740","headline":"华山歌 · 刘禹锡","name":"华山歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪罏作高山，元气鼓其橐。\n俄然神功就，峻拔在寥廓。\n灵迹露指爪，杀气见棱角。\n凡木不敢生，神僊聿来托。\n天资帝王宅，以我爲关钥。\n能令下国人，一见换神骨。\n高山固无限，如此方爲岳。\n丈夫无特达，虽贵犹碌碌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}